// Violet AI Script -- Dialogue Initiation Only
// Non-joinable encounter: she initiates dialogue then vanishes
//
// All party AI, combat observations, and idle behavior removed.
// Violet is no longer a joinable companion.

// --- DIALOGUE INITIATION ---
// When seeing the player for the first time, initiate conversation
IF
  See(Player1)
  Global("AAVioletMet","GLOBAL",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    StartDialogNoSet(Player1)
END
